        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When this transport is destroyed, roll one D6 before any embarked models disembark and before removing it from play.  On a 6, it explodes, and each unit within 6&quot; suffers D6 moral wounds.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
      <modifiers>
