        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this model is reduced to 0 wounds, roll a D6 before removing it from the battlefield and before any embarked models disembark. On a 6 it explodes, and each unit within 3&quot; suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
