    <profile name="Ammo Runt" id="e6b8-67b6-8769-a3f9" hidden="false" page="102" publicationId="11b5-77b9-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, when the bearer makes a ranged attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.  We recommend placing an Ammo Runt model next to the unit as a reminder, removing it once this ability has been used (an Ammo runt does not count as a model for any rules purposes).</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Painboy" id="b759-8e29-4f52-1eba" hidden="false" page="95" publicationId="11b5-77b9-pubN65537" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Unit">
