    <profile name="Runtherd (Restriction)" id="bf44-f0b1-e2e1-2ebd" hidden="false" page="97" publicationId="11b5-77b9-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged, you must include at least one GRETCHIN INFANTRY unit in a Detachment for each RUNTHERD unit in that Detachment. RUNTHERD units do not take up slots in a Detachment.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Grot Lash" id="181d-edb9-b969-f38e" hidden="false" page="97" publicationId="11b5-77b9-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer gains the following ability: &apos;Grot Lash (Aura): While a friendly GRETCHIN INFANTRY unit is within 3&quot; of any models equipped with a grot-lash, add 1&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit.&apos;</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Squig Hound" id="c9f7-7787-5db5-7911" hidden="false" page="97" publicationId="11b5-77b9-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer gains the following ability: &apos;Squig Hound (Aura): While a friendly GRETCHIN unit is within 3&quot; of the bearer, models in that unit ignore modifiers to Combat Attrition tests.&apos;</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
