          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">(Aura) While a friendly ORKS unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, it has a 6+ invulnerable save. The range of this aura ability can never be increased, unless specifically stated otherwise.</characteristic>
