            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Blast. Each time this weapon is selected to shoot with, roll 2D6 to determine the Strength of all its attacks: on an 11+, each successful hit inflicts D3 mortal wounds on the target in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
