          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, when the bearer repairs a VEHICLE model, that model can regain 1 additional lost wound.

We recommend placing a Grot Oiler model next to the unit as a reminder, removing it once this ability has been used.  (a Grot Oiler does not count as a model for any rules purposes)</characteristic>
