          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, in your Movement phase, after the bearer makes a normal move or Advances, you can select one point on the battlefield the bearer moved across this phase.  Roll one D6 for each unit within 3&quot; of that point, subtracting 1 if that unit is a CHARACTER (excluding VEHICLE or MONSTER units): on a 4+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
