      <profiles>
        <profile name="Grot Krew" id="1401-3201-c7a2-759a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each Big Gun and its grot krew are treated as a single model for all rules purposes. The krew must remain within 1&quot; of their Big Gun and cannot be targeted or attacked separately. The range and visibility of all attacks made by a Big Gun are measured from the Big Gun, not the krew.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Big Gunz" id="4250-f806-dd84-ad30" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The first time this unit is set up on the battlefield, all of its Big Gunz must be placed within 6&quot; of at least one other Big Gun, and with each grot krew within 1&quot; of their Big Gun. From that point onwards, each Big Gun operates independently and is treated as a separate unit for all rules purposes.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
