        <profile name="Fixin&apos; Jobs" id="a185-1065-6696-9c52" hidden="false" page="196" publicationId="7573-8d1b-acdf-2de8" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can repair one friendly &lt;CLAN&gt; VEHICLE model within 1&quot; (it cannot repair itself). If it does, that model regains up to D3 lost wounds. A model can only be repaired once each turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Rippa Klaws" id="388d-53bc-35c9-7a96" hidden="false" page="196" publicationId="7573-8d1b-acdf-2de8" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If the bearer is equipped with 2 dread rippa klaws, each time it fights, it can make 1 additional attack with 1 dread rippa klaw.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
