            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model finishes a charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of it and roll one D6; on a 2+, that units suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
