              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a WARBOSS model is embarked upon this TRANSPORT, the bearer gains the WARBOSS model&apos;s Warboss, Beastboss or Flashiest Gitz aura ability</characteristic>
