            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, if a 1 is rolled when using the bearer&apos;s Sawbonez ability you can re-roll the dice.
We recommend placing a Grot Orderly model next to the unit as a reminder, removing it once this ability has been used (a Grot Orderly does not count as a model for any rules purposes).</characteristic>
