          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">PSYKER model only. This Relic can be taken by a PSYKER VEHICLE model.
- Each time the bearer attempts to manifest a Witchfire psychic power, add 1 to the Psychic test.
- Each time the bearer would lose a wound as a result of suffering Perils of the Warp, roll one D6: on a 4+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
