                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">WITCHFIRE: Da Krunch has a warp charge value of 6.  If manifested, select one enemy unit that is within 18&quot; of this PSYKER.  Roll one D6 for each model in that unit: for each roll of 6, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.  IF the result of the Psychic test was 9 or more, add 1 to rolls when resolving this psychic power.</characteristic>
