- The bearer has a 4+ invulnerable save.
- Add 1 to armour saving throws made for the bearer.
- After the bearer makes a charge move, you can select on enemy unit within 1&quot; of it and roll one D6: on a 2+ that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
